out such assets.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Appendix A: Wells Fargo\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Effective June 30, 2020, C Class shares will convert automatically into A Class shares on the 25th day of the month (or, if the 25th is not a business day, the next business day thereafter) following the eighth anniversary of the month on which the purchase order was accepted, provided that the Fund or the financial intermediary through which a shareholder purchased C Class shares has records verifying that the C Class shares have been held for at least eight years. The first conversion of C Class to A Class shares under this new policy would take place on July 25, 2020 for all C Class shares that were held for more than eight years as of June 30, 2020.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A-4 Prospectus - Appendix\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Back to Table of Contents\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Appendix B\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 GLOSSARY\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ACH                         Automated Clearing House\par Advisers Act                Investment Advisers Act of 1940, as amended\par American Beacon or Manager  American Beacon Advisors, Inc.\par Beacon Funds or Trust       American Beacon Funds\par Board                       Board of Trustees\par Brexit                      The United Kingdom's departure from the European Union\par Capital Gains Distributions Distributions of realized net capital gains\par CDSC                        Contingent Deferred Sales Charge\par CFTC                        Commodity Futures Trading Commission\par CPO                         Commodity Pool Operator\par Denial of Services          A cybersecurity incident that results in shareholders or service providers being unable to access electronic systems\par Distributor                 Resolute Investment Distributors, Inc.\par Dividends                   Distributions from the Fund's net investment income\par DRD                         Dividends-received deduction\par EU                          European Union\par