r acquisition of Five in March 2021. These include 12 employees in North America and 218 employees in Central Europe EU countries (Croatia).\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 * The increase in North America from 2020 to 2021 includes 202 acquired employees and 20 headcount in Latin America (Mexico) in connection with our acquisition of Levvel in March 2021.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 E. Share Ownership.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 For information regarding the share ownership of our directors and executive officers, see "Item 6.B.- Compensation-Outstanding Equity Awards, Grants and Option Exercises" and "Item 7.A-Major Shareholders."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Item 7. Major Shareholders and Related Party Transactions\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 * Major Shareholders.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The following table sets forth the beneficial ownership of our shares as of August 15, 2021:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 * each person, or group of affiliated persons, who is known by us to beneficially own 5% or more of our Class A ordinary shares;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 * each person, or group of affiliated persons, who is known by us to beneficially own 5% or more of our Class B ordinary shares;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 * each person, or group of affiliated persons, who is known by us to beneficially own 5% or more of our Class A ordinary shares and Class B ordinary shares in the aggregate;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 * each of our executive officers;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 * each of our directors; and\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 * all of our executive officers and directors as a group.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The percentage ownership and voting power information shown in the table is based upon 38,436,909 Class A ordinary shares and 17,286,701 Class B ordinary shares outstanding as of August 15, 2021.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 We have determined beneficial ownership in accordance with the rules of the SEC. These rules generally attribute beneficial ownership of securities to persons who possess sole or shared voting power or i