 statements and for other services provided to the Group:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2                                                                                                     2021         2020          2019\par                                                                                                     \u163\'00\'A3    '000          \u163\'00\'A3'000     \u163\'00\'A3'000\par Audit of the financial statements ....................................................................\u163\'00\'A3    813     \u163\'00\'A3     840   \u163\'00\'A3 741\par Subsidiary local statutory audits.....................................................................     87            103       95\par SOX attestation fees .......................................................................................     1,470         832       -\par Total audit fees..............................................................................................     2,370         1,775     836\par Initial public offering expenses ......................................................................     -             -         -\par Secondary offering expenses..........................................................................     -             -         150\par Other SEC filings review expenses ................................................................       -             -         36\par Total audit related fees.................................................................................     -             -         186\par Total auditor's remuneration......................................................................  \u163\'00\'A3    2,370 \u163\'00\'A3 1,775 \u163\'00\'A3     1,022\par                                                                                                                                   \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 F-28\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 7. Particulars of Employees (including Directors)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2                       