he Group does not actively engage in the trading of financial assets for speculative purposes nor does it write options.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Sensitivity\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Group is exposed to translation and transaction foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  exchange risk. Several other \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in addition to the presentation \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Sterling are used, including Romanian Lei (RON), Euro (EUR) and US Dollars (USD).\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Group experiences \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  exchange differences arising upon retranslation of monetary items (primarily short-terminter-company balances and borrowings), which are recognised as an expense in the period the difference occurs. The Group endeavours to match the cash inflows and outflows in the various \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ; the Group typically invoices its clients in their local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , and pays its local expenses in local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  as a means to mitigate this risk.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  denominated financial assets and liabilities which expose the Group to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  risk are disclosed below. The amounts shown are translated into GBP at the closing rate:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 June 30, 2021                                         GBP              EUR               USD      RON   Others TOTAL\par \u163\'00\'A3'000                                                          \u163\'00\'A3'000            \u163\'00\'A3'000    \u163\'00\'A3'000    \u163\'00\'A3'