ce following the closing of the sale of the Captive. The aggregate selling price of the Captive was \u163\'00\'A33.6 million and the Group recognised a gain on disposal of subsidiary of \u163\'00\'A32.2 million.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Auditor's remuneration:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Group recognised the following fees from its auditors in respect of the audit of the financial statements and for other services provided to the Group:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 2021\u163\'00\'A3'000                         2020\u163\'00\'A3'000 2019\u163\'00\'A3'000\par Audit of the financial statements \u163\'00\'A3         813   \u163\'00\'A3 840   \u163\'00\'A3 741\par Subsidiary local statutory audits 87        103   95\par SOX attestation fees              1,470     832   -\par Total audit fees                  2,370     1,775 836\par Initial public offering expenses  -         -     -\par Secondary offering expenses       -         -     150\par Other SEC filings review expenses -         -     36\par Total audit related fees          -         -     186\par Total auditor's remuneration      \u163\'00\'A3         2,370 \u163\'00\'A3 1,775 \u163\'00\'A3 1,022\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 F-28\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 7.Particulars of Employees (including Directors)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 2021No.                                       2020No.    2019No.\par Average number of staff employed by the group during the year (including directors):\par Number of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operational\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  staff                   6,943      5,633   4,902\par Number of administrative staff                744        601     503\par Number of management staff                    8          8       7\par Total                                         7,695      6,242   5,412\par                                               \par \par 2021\u163\'00\'A3'000                                     20201\u163\'00\'A3'000 20191\u163\'00\'A3'000\par Aggregate payroll costs of the above w