hole or any part of the business, property, assets of any such member or any such mortgage, charge or other security interest (whenever created, arising or having arisen) becoming enforceable;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (iii) any such agreement, arrangement, lease, licence, franchise, permit or instrument being terminated or the rights, liabilities, obligations or interests of any such member being modified or affected, or any obligation or liability arising or any action being taken or arising thereunder;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (iv) the rights, liabilities, obligations or interests of any such member of the Wider Dialog Group in or in respect of any such agreement, arrangement, lease, licence, franchise, permit or instrument, or the business of any such member with any person, firm or company (or any arrangement relating to any such interests or business) being terminated or adversely modified or affected or any onerous obligation or liability arising or any adverse action being taken thereunder;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (v) any liability of any such member to make any severance, termination, bonus or other payment to any of its directors or other officers;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (vi) any such member ceasing to be able to carry on business under any name under which it currently does so;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (vii) the value of any such member or its financial or trading position or prospects being prejudiced or adversely affected; or\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (viii) the creation or acceleration of any liability (actual or contingent) by any such member other than trade creditors or other liabilities incurred in the ordinary course of business,\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 and no event having occurred which, under any provision of any agreement, arrangement, lease, licence, franchise, permit or other instrument to which any member of the Wider Dialog Group is a party or by or to which any such member or any of its assets may be bound, entitled or subject, could result in the occurrence of any of the events or circumstances described or referred to in the Conditions set out in sub-paragraphs (i) to (viii) above;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Certain events occurring since 31 December 2019\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (m) except as Disclosed, no member of the Wider Dialog Group having, since 31 December 2019 :\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (i) issued or agreed to issue or authorised or announced its intention to issue or authorise the issue of additional shares of any class, or securities convertible into, or exchangeable for, shares of any class, or rights, warrants or options to subscribe for, or acquire, any such shares, securities or convertible securities (except, as between Dialog and its wholly-owned subsidiaries or between the wholly-owned subsidiaries of Dialog, and except for the issue or transfer out of treasury of Dialog Shares (or interests therein) on the exercise of options or vesting of share awards in the ordinary course under the Dialog Share Plans);\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (ii) transferred or sold or agreed to transfer or sell, or authorised the transfer or sale of, Dialog Shares (or interests therein) out of treasury (except for the transfer of Dialog Shares out of treasury on the exercise of options or vesting of share awards in the ordinary course under the Dialog Share Plans);\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (iii) purchased, redeemed or repaid, or announced any proposal to purchase, redeem or repay, any of its own shares or other securities, or reduced or made any other change (excepting any change referred to in sub-paragraph (i) above) to any part of its share capital;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (iv) recommended, declared, paid or made or authorised the recommendation, declaration, payment or making of any bonus, dividend or other distribution (whether payable in cash or otherwise), other than bonuses, dividends or other distributions, whether payable in cash or otherwise, lawfully paid or made by any wholly-owned subsidiary of Dialog to Dialog or an