ht22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , and also in order to achieve a return within its seeded investment funds. The instruments are recognised at fair value. The fair value of the contracts is calculated using the market forward contract rates prevailing at the period end date. The net gain or loss on forward \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  contracts at fair value is included within revenue from other group activities.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  Derivative financial assets              2013      2012 \par                                        GBP'000   GBP'000 \par ------------------------------------  --------  -------- \par  Forward \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  contracts \par   held to hedge cash flow                    -        33 \par  Forward \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  contracts         43         - \par   held for trading \par ------------------------------------  --------  -------- \par  Total derivative financial assets          43        33 \par ------------------------------------  --------  -------- \par  \par  \par  Derivative financial liabilities             2013      2012 \par                                            GBP'000   GBP'000 \par ----------------------------------------  --------  -------- \par  Forward \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  contracts           (25)         - \par   held to hedge cash flow \par  Forward \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  contracts \par   held for trading                               -      (48) \par ----------------------------------------  --------  -------- \par  Total derivative financial liabilities       (25)      (48) \par ----------------------------------------  --------  -------- \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Derivative financial instruments held to hedge cash flow\f28