uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  other than Sterling. The principal \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  giving rise to this risk are primarily the US Dollar, the Swiss Franc, the Euro and the Canadian Dollar.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 In the year ended 31 March 2013, the Group invoiced the following amounts in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  other than Sterling:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                             Local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2      Value in \par                                      value    reporting \par                                                \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par                                       '000      GBP'000 \par -------------------------  ---------------  ----------- \par  US Dollar (USD)                    12,849        8,134 \par  Swiss Franc (CHF)                   6,917        4,671 \par  Canadian Dollar (CAD)                 648          409 \par  Euro (EUR)                            310          256 \par  Australian Dollar (AUD)                17           11 \par -------------------------  ---------------  ----------- \par  Total                                           13,481 \par -------------------------  ---------------  ----------- \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The value of revenues for the year ended 31 March 2013 that were denominated in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  other than Sterling was GBP13.5 million (73% of total revenues). For the year ended 31 March 2012: GBP14.8 million (72% of total revenues).\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Record plc\f28 \uc2 \f2 's policy is to reduce the risk associated with the Company's sales denominated in foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by using forward fixed rate \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  sale